From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: utzcoz <utzcoz@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 13:18:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] gfxstream/guest: use the DRM fourcc codes on Apple

AndroidHardwareBuffer.cpp needs the DRM fourcc codes to describe buffer
formats and includes them for Android and Linux only, so it does not compile
on Apple. The codes are plain constants and apply as they are.

This file is only built for Android and emulated Android, so it is not part of
what goes upstream for a plain macOS build.
---
 src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/AndroidHardwareBuffer.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/AndroidHardwareBuffer.cpp b/src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/AndroidHardwareBuffer.cpp
index 8450fbe..f7f49ff 100644
--- a/src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/AndroidHardwareBuffer.cpp
+++ b/src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/AndroidHardwareBuffer.cpp
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
 #include "AndroidHardwareBuffer.h"
 #include "util/detect_os.h"
 
-#if DETECT_OS_ANDROID || DETECT_OS_LINUX
+#if DETECT_OS_ANDROID || DETECT_OS_LINUX || DETECT_OS_APPLE
 #include <drm_fourcc.h>
 #define DRM_FORMAT_YVU420_ANDROID fourcc_code('9', '9', '9', '7')
 #define DRM_FORMAT_D16_UNORM fourcc_code('9', '9', '9', '6')
